{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-12_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-12","title":"一场相见","storyCode":"11-14","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-12_end.txt","sourceHash":"3a733e4943c1e9b01993643242fdcfe75508faa3c7255ca494e6a00cebee98ac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"推进之王打开了通往诸王长眠之所的大门，维多利亚千年的历史正奔向她。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的门扉横亘在地下空间之中，除了众人的呼吸，没有一点声音。\n当然，死亡总是寂静的，再辉煌的王权都不能改变这一点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......诸王长眠之所。字面意思......是列王的坟墓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们听到什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，除了我们几个的呼吸声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毫无疑问，有什么声音正在这个空间中回荡。\n那是梦醒的呢喃，还是疲惫的呻吟？\n他们在注视着自己。\n“维多利亚”在注视着自己。\n当她清楚地感受到这一点的时候，一种烦躁油然而生。\n他们在期待什么？他们在为自己构想一种怎样的未来？\n她早就腻烦了被这些所追逐的日子。\n她也已经很久没有理会那只如黄金一般的生物的呼唤了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"金色的鬃毛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，尽快完成这个任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛和自救军会需要我们帮忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地上的这些......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......光线太暗，一开始我还以为是什么上流社会的新奇装饰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有交战的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一场无比惨烈的战斗......不，这是一片浸透死亡的泥潭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血迹。蜿蜒的血迹，一路爬行至道路尽头的门缝背后，又或者，是从那扇巨大的门后爬出来的。\n它们早已干涸，只留下暗红色的扭曲残渍，覆盖在破碎的砖石之上。\n被一同覆盖的，还有残损的箭头，刀剑的碎片，法术轰击留下的深坑。\n还有一些更为巨大的痕迹，如同一道道能撕扯开此处静谧的伤疤，裸露在神圣的大门上。\n虽然附近没有留下任何一具尸体，但所有经历过战场的人都能轻易地想象出这里曾经发生过什么。\n两群人抱着必死的信念而战，很显然，他们都遂了愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从血迹颜色来看，好几年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前......难道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在这里的是萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能认出他们的武器。这些武器......与当年袭击塔楼骑士的萨卡兹战士使用的是同一批。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......与现在外面的萨卡兹士兵用的不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹后来佩戴的刀剑都是海布里区的军工厂里造出来的，和维多利亚军队用的制式武器很接近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们没这么粗糙。也远远没有......这么野蛮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得......这些生锈的刀砍向我同僚的身体的声音。它们很重，在劈裂甲胄之前，会先震断骨头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果仅仅只是看见这些痕迹就会让我止步不前的话，我大概无法度过逃离伦蒂尼姆后的任何一个夜晚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......维娜，情况出乎我们的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些声音搅得她头痛。\n他们在催促。他们在诉说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸王之息还在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持冷静，继续前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与这些萨卡兹战斗的人是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无法判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方没有留下任何痕迹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能是我没有见过的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铅踝先生，你当雇佣兵多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一个月十四年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定见过出产自大部分国家地区的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见过，但见不全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是个普通的雇佣兵，没怎么见过各国精锐部队的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是见过的话，我活不到现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，因陀罗，你们退回到通道之外警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像以前一样，确保撤退的线路，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿我不会错过什么精彩的桥段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王，我们不能贸然继续前进......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能听到发生在我们头顶的战斗吗，达格达？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能。这样的震动......我能想象得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能空着手回去，达格达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这把剑能阻止这一切，哪怕仅仅只是让牺牲与屠戮的脚步放缓些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就会去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会把这视为责任，这只是......一次小小的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和敲掉来找麻烦的打手的门牙没什么不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，你说的。走到这一步以后，我们已经不剩下什么回头的机会了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来不是很痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，这可是在王宫地下打架的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿他们不会遇到什么要动手的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我可是为了你做了如此之大的牺牲啊。万一你被人一箭放倒，总得有个人替你大喊一声吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我的傻汉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得第一次见到维娜的时候，她的样子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她呀，拽得要命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明那时候她个子小小的，脾气却很大，不怎么爱说话。你甚至看不出她很生气，可她动起手来..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...哈哈，你说都是谁教会她打架的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说是她的老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原来以为她的老师是诺伯特区的哪位斗殴大王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来知道了维娜的出身，倒是说得通了，大概那位老师是个连脑子里都塞满了肌肉的骑士吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，王子啊公主什么的不都是穿着绣花裙跑都跑不快的类型吗？什么样的老师会教她跟野兽似的打架啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，她第一次跟我们坦白身份的时候，我还以为她在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜才不会在这种关系到我们生死的问题上说笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我还以为只是些新崛起的帮派，想找我们格拉斯哥帮的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果是针对王位继承人的灭口行动？哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那帮家伙的拳头倒确实很硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时觉得，陪着一位王储冒险说不定比混迹街头刺激得多，更何况，这位王储还深得我心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后不知不觉地，我们就跟着维娜逃出伦蒂尼姆，跟着她四处流浪，又跟着她回到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在......如果传奇里的英雄有得选，他们更乐意窝在沙发上喝一大口冰啤酒，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......后悔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，我们都已经走到这了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的回忆录都开了头了，我还想拿它大赚特赚一笔呢！《伟大的维娜陛下和她伟大的朋友们》，只差出版商找上门了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就你肚子里那点可怜的词？算了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜说了，挺好看的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想......那间被我们砸坏了招牌的酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是维娜带着我们打的第一场胜仗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上我们把酒窖里的货都喝光了。最后是贝尔德把我们一个接一个地背到卡车上，趁着警察过来之前，带着我们逃回了家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，你又记错了。背你的人分明是老子，贝尔德自己喝得以为马桶是方向盘，你让她开车试试？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想的只是......不管在什么地方，我们都还能像过去那样，聚在一起做出点名堂对吧？哪怕只是从别的帮派那里抢到一个酒吧也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉娜，你说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来这么多天了，为什么维娜一次都没有主动提起过，要回格拉斯哥帮看看啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"临行之前，博士给了我这把钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士说，这是凯尔希医生通过谈判得到的......只有它能打开我们面前这扇通往诸王长眠之所的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我手中的这把钥匙曾经属于一位德拉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......另一把钥匙在哪里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"另一把钥匙。\n属于阿斯兰王室的钥匙，也能打开面前的这扇门。本该由她的父亲交到她手上，她却从未见过那把钥匙的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么突然问起这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚想起来，关于那把......诸王之息的另一个传说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“阿斯兰帕夏手执利剑，试图征服异邦的最后一块土地。”\n“德拉克王的火焰法术奔向他，他的盔甲被烧成了莓果的颜色，一滴滴消失在火焰中。可他的剑比盔甲更硬。”\n“在刺入德拉克王的身体里的那一刻，阿斯兰帕夏手中的剑已只剩下一半。”\n“德拉克王因此保住性命，而阿斯兰帕夏也失去了自己的右手。”\n“在德拉克与阿斯兰签订盟约之后，这把剑亦被重铸，自此成为开启维多利亚数百年光辉的象征。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的祖先......曾经差点杀死一位德拉克王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我此刻正拿着红龙后裔的钥匙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打开这扇通往诸王长眠之所的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这里，无论是德拉克还是阿斯兰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都只是维多利亚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"门开了。\n这比她想象得更轻松，轻松到仿佛一切都早已准备好，只等着她这个轻轻的动作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g9_kingrest"},{"type":"narration","text":"在诸王长眠之所——\n维多利亚千年的历史正奔向她，奔向离去又归来的阿斯兰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
